      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thanks for calling this out!\n\nWe require all sellers to provide accurate descriptions of their store.\n\nThe Emerald crab role now has a more detailed description:\n\n> Unlocks benefits for the Hermit Crab tier in Idle Home‚ Spirits of the Sea‚ Quick Draw‚ and Geolocator Remapped․ Additional information about the benefits is available in each respective world․\n\nPlease let us know if you notice any other issues. We appreciate your help.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-23T01:54:54.579Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Subscription options should be required to have detailed in-menu explanations of the in-world benefits or group benefits that they provide. People are less likely to warm up to this monetization system if the majority of possible purchases don't even properly describe what is being purchased.\n\nFor example: as much as I'd love to shell out $20 for an \"Emerald Crab Role\" (no further description), I don't have a single clue what it does.",
